      "updated": 1770949566
    },
    {
      "id": "698e8f07000000000091fec7",
      "text": "[[歓迎.icon]] いらっしゃい！ようこそ！ [suto3.icon][yosider.icon][Hiro Aki.icon][caki.icon][koyoshi.icon][はるひ.icon][nomadoor.icon][hoagecko.icon][W7kA9pX2.icon][meganii.icon][who.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1770950408,
      "updated": 1771049580
    },
    {
      "id": "698fe62600000000007ca2fe",
      "text": " こんにちは！お邪魔します！[vlzs.icon]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1771038246,
      "updated": 1771038260
    },
    {
      "id": "698e8f09000000000091fec8",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1770950409,
      "updated": 1770950409
    },
    {
      "id": "698fdc3c0000000000f5dfac",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1771035708,
      "updated": 1776585756
    },
    {
      "id": "69dcf6e70000000000c8ca36",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1776088808,
      "updated": 1776088808
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbe7",
      "text": "ここはvlzsのページです[Cosense Beaver.icon]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1787832924
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbe8",
      "text": " 自己紹介などを書きましょう",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1787832924
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbe9",
      "text": " （自己紹介を書いてみたけれど、書いた内容の一部を毎日数回思い出して具合が悪い気分になり、井戸端に訪れにくくて自分の所属してる場所が減り体調も悪くなったので、消した）",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1788586035
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902b620000000000a6425d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787833186,
      "updated": 1787833187
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902b620000000000a6425e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787833187,
      "updated": 1787833187
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9ba7f5000000000027cfee",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1788585974,
      "updated": 1788585974
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9ba7f5000000000027cfef",
      "text": "自分の感覚のストリーミングに敏感みたい",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1788585974,
      "updated": 1788585974
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9ba7f5000000000027cff0",
      "text": " 作業に集中しているときの体の変化や",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1788585974,
      "updated": 1788585974
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9ba7f5000000000027cff1",
      "text": "  from [座って作業をしてたらドキドキしてきた]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1788585974,
      "updated": 1788585974
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9ba7f5000000000027cff2",
      "text": " 薬物(カフェイン)によく反応してる事を意識してる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1788585974,
      "updated": 1788586581
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9ba7f5000000000027cff3",
      "text": "  from [2026/08/13#6a7dca4b0000000000575a87]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1788585974,
      "updated": 1788585974
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9ba7f5000000000027cff4",
      "text": " これらを合わせると[vlzs.icon]は自分の感覚によく注目しているといえそう？",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1788585974,
      "updated": 1788586565
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbf6",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1787832924
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbf7",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1788586050
    },
    {
